# Third-party notices

This file records the dependencies used by SWE 0.1.0. Rust dependencies may be
statically linked into the `swe_native` wheel, so their discovered license
texts follow the inventory. Python dependencies are installed as separate
distributions and carry their own license files; they are inventoried here so a
lockfile change cannot silently change the license surface.

Generated for Rust with `cargo about generate --all-features --locked about.hbs`.

